        <h1 id="page-title">More than<br>just <em>playing.</em></h1>

        <p class="intro">
          I’m <strong>Shaurya Mittal</strong>. PLAYYY is my gaming portfolio — a place to bring together the games I enjoy, interactive ideas I explore and digital projects I work on. It’s where curiosity about games meets the excitement of creating something of my own.
        </p>

        <div class="actions">
          <a class="button" href="https://shaurya1233.github.io/PLAYYYY/">
            Explore PLAYYY <span aria-hidden="true">&nbsp;↗</span>
          </a>

          <a class="text-link" href="#what-im-into">
            A little more about me ↓
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <figure class="portrait-column">
        <div class="portrait-frame">
          <img
            class="portrait"
            src="../kkk.jpg"
            alt="Profile image of Shaurya Mittal, creator of the PLAYYY gaming portfolio"
            title="Shaurya Mittal — PLAYYY"
            loading="eager"
            decoding="async"
            fetchpriority="high">
        </div>

        <figcaption class="image-caption">
          <span>PLAYYY / Profile</span>
          <span>Shaurya Mittal</span>
        </figcaption>
      </figure>
    </section>

    <div class="wrap divider" role="presentation"></div>

    <section class="wrap details" id="what-im-into" aria-labelledby="details-title">
      <p class="section-label">01 / The perspective</p>

      <div>
        <h2 id="details-title">A space for games, ideas and making.</h2>

        <div class="details-copy">
          <p>
            Gaming is not only about reaching the next level. It is also about the worlds people imagine, the systems that make play feel alive and the details that turn a simple idea into an experience worth remembering.
          </p>

          <p>
            PLAYYY is a growing collection of that curiosity. This portfolio is intended to showcase my gaming interests, experiments and projects as they take shape — without pretending that unfinished ideas are completed releases.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="focus-grid" aria-label="Areas of interest">
          <div class="focus-item">
            <small>01</small>
            <span>Gaming & game worlds</span>
          </div>

          <div class="focus-item">
            <small>02</small>
            <span>Interactive experiences</span>
          </div>

          <div class="focus-item">
            <small>03</small>
            <span>Web-based games</span>
          </div>

          <div class="focus-item">
            <small>04</small>
            <span>Creative experiments</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <div class="wrap footer-inner">
      <span>© <span id="year">2026</span> PLAYYY · Shaurya Mittal</span>

      <a href="https://shaurya1233.github.io/PLAYYYY/">
        Return to PLAYYY <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <script>
    // Keeps the copyright year current without relying on an external library.
    document.getElementById('year').textContent = new Date().getFullYear();
  </script>
</body>
</html>
